 "title": "The Wexsler-ish Exam: A Parody IQ Test",
 "tagline": "Take a tiny fake IQ test, then see how scoring, hidden factors and stats tricks bend the number.",
 "lead": "This is a playful parody of IQ-style tests. You answer six quick items and get a score on a bell curve. Then you see how the same answers can turn into very different numbers.",
